  "source": "hyperledger-labs/splice-wallet-kernel — /api-specs/openrpc-dapp-api.json",
  "openrpcVersion": "0.5.0",
  "note": [
    "Golden vectors for the CIP-0103 dApp API codec, shared by the Kotlin and",
    "Swift SDKs. Each entry in `vectors` must decode into the named type and",
    "re-encode to a document equal to `json` (compared as parsed JSON, so key",
    "order does not matter). That fixpoint property is what catches a codec",
    "that silently drops an optional field or invents a null.",
    "",
    "Encoding rule these vectors assume: absent optionals are OMITTED, never",
    "emitted as null. Decoding is tolerant and reads an explicit null as",
    "absent, which is why `invalid` contains no null-for-optional cases.",
    "",
    "Note there is no `statusChanged` event: it appears in prose descriptions",
    "of this protocol but not in OpenRPC 0.5.0. Status is polled via `status`."
  ],
